    m_Alignment: 0
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 1
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "With holographic 3D pyramid you can see a real hologram of your 3d-model
    inside the pyramid and see it from all sides (front, left, right and back). \n\nFor
    self-production of 3D pyramid You will need:\n\n-Pencil\n-Ruler\n- A4 sheet of
    paper\n-Scissors\n- Sharp knife (eg stationery)\n- Transparent adhesive tape
    or plastic (narrow 12mm)\n- Thin transparent plastic or plexiglass (suitable
    boxes of CD discs)\n\nThe principle of making 3D pyramids to reproduce holograms
    is very simple:\n\n1. Draw a stencil faces of the pyramid on paper and cut it
    with scissors"
